    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441220/extras/256d93d37cd9fa5f153c315417ecb68e.avif?t=1739351394\" data-has-big width=800 height=484 /></span><strong>A Living Story, Shaped by Your Words</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a rich fantasy world where every conversation becomes part of an unfolding tale. <i>ChatNPC</i> is a <strong>AI-driven visual novel</strong>, where every character is powered by a local large language model - meaning your private chats stay private on your computer, with no cloud processing or online servers involved. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441220/extras/19fa62a6a849e8c37584e2c7af1193ed.poster.avif?t=1739351394\" width=542 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441220/extras/19fa62a6a849e8c37584e2c7af1193ed.webm?t=1739351394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441220/extras/19fa62a6a849e8c37584e2c7af1193ed.mp4?t=1739351394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>AI-Driven Storytelling</strong><br>Meet a cast of unforgettable characters: the warm-hearted tavern maid with a secret past, the grizzled warrior carrying old regrets, the mischievous elf hiding forbidden knowledge, or the enigmatic vampire who speaks in riddles. Every dialogue is unique, every choice reshapes the story, and every encounter brings new mysteries to uncover. Your words guide the narrative, forging bonds, following quests, and revealing hidden secrets. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441220/extras/638d5346f18c74a8d2755c3bd799c96c.poster.avif?t=1739351394\" width=620 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441220/extras/638d5346f18c74a8d2755c3bd799c96c.webm?t=1739351394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441220/extras/638d5346f18c74a8d2755c3bd799c96c.mp4?t=1739351394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>A World That Responds to You</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the cozy warmth of a medieval tavern to the vast unknown beyond, <i>ChatNPC</i> offers an ever-evolving journey shaped entirely by your interactions. Engage in deep conversations, uncover rumors and legends, and influence the world around you - not through battle, but through words.   <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441220/extras/37491d55e09da3332bb2ec7bad7c8866.poster.avif?t=1739351394\" width=620 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441220/extras/37491d55e09da3332bb2ec7bad7c8866.webm?t=1739351394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441220/extras/37491d55e09da3332bb2ec7bad7c8866.mp4?t=1739351394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Infinite Stories</strong>  <br> No two playthroughs are ever the same. Every chat is a fresh adventure, every NPC a storyteller, and every session a new chapter in a tale only you can write.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to lose yourself in a story that listens?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441220/extras/256d93d37cd9fa5f153c315417ecb68e.avif?t=1739351394\" data-has-big width=800 height=484 /></span><strong>A Living Story, Shaped by Your Words</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a rich fantasy world where every conversation becomes part of an unfolding tale. <i>ChatNPC</i> is a <strong>AI-driven visual novel</strong>, where every character is powered by a local large language model - meaning your private chats stay private on your computer, with no cloud processing or online servers involved. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441220/extras/19fa62a6a849e8c37584e2c7af1193ed.poster.avif?t=1739351394\" width=542 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441220/extras/19fa62a6a849e8c37584e2c7af1193ed.webm?t=1739351394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441220/extras/19fa62a6a849e8c37584e2c7af1193ed.mp4?t=1739351394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>AI-Driven Storytelling</strong><br>Meet a cast of unforgettable characters: the warm-hearted tavern maid with a secret past, the grizzled warrior carrying old regrets, the mischievous elf hiding forbidden knowledge, or the enigmatic vampire who speaks in riddles. Every dialogue is unique, every choice reshapes the story, and every encounter brings new mysteries to uncover. Your words guide the narrative, forging bonds, following quests, and revealing hidden secrets. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441220/extras/638d5346f18c74a8d2755c3bd799c96c.poster.avif?t=1739351394\" width=620 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441220/extras/638d5346f18c74a8d2755c3bd799c96c.webm?t=1739351394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441220/extras/638d5346f18c74a8d2755c3bd799c96c.mp4?t=1739351394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>A World That Responds to You</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the cozy warmth of a medieval tavern to the vast unknown beyond, <i>ChatNPC</i> offers an ever-evolving journey shaped entirely by your interactions. Engage in deep conversations, uncover rumors and legends, and influence the world around you - not through battle, but through words.   <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441220/extras/37491d55e09da3332bb2ec7bad7c8866.poster.avif?t=1739351394\" width=620 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441220/extras/37491d55e09da3332bb2ec7bad7c8866.webm?t=1739351394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441220/extras/37491d55e09da3332bb2ec7bad7c8866.mp4?t=1739351394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Infinite Stories</strong>  <br> No two playthroughs are ever the same. Every chat is a fresh adventure, every NPC a storyteller, and every session a new chapter in a tale only you can write.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to lose yourself in a story that listens?</p>",
    "short_description": "Immerse yourself in ChatNPC, a retro pixel-art adventure where every conversation unlocks new stories. Interact with unique AI-driven characters, explore vibrant settings, and shape your journey through dynamic dialogue in this engaging, simplified RPG experience.",
